  297: 'We know that the Late Platonists were interested in exploring what they viewed as the higher ‘realms’ of reality: the noetic reality, containing the archetypes of our lower world, and potentially a more unified ‘plane’ of ultimate unity beyond that noetic hyperkosmos.',
